sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant TS as ToolService
    participant E as DefaultGuardEngine
    participant G as AGT PolicyGuard
    participant P as StructuredPolicy
    participant V as ParameterRule
    participant O as GuardOutcome
    TS->>E: checkToolInput：tenant-B 的 lookup
    E->>G: check(payload, context)
    G->>G: 构建可信 tenant-A 身份及 PolicyRequest
    G->>P: evaluate(request)
    P->>P: validateEffective：检查工具及权限
    P->>V: validate：equalsContext = tenantId
    V-->>P: 抛 GovernanceException(context_binding_denied)
    P-->>G: PolicyDecision.DENY
    G-->>E: GuardDecision.BLOCK
    E->>E: 记录发现，短路后续 Guard
    E-->>TS: BLOCK 的 GuardOutcome
    TS->>O: payloadOrThrow()
    O-->>TS: 抛 GuardBlockedException
    Note over TS,O: lookup 方法体未执行，工具副作用为 0
